     fhir:Narrative.status [ fhir:value "extensions" ] ;
     fhir:Narrative.div "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: ValueSet ng-hiv-tb-preventive-therapy-vs</b></p><a name=\"ng-hiv-tb-preventive-therapy-vs\"> </a><a name=\"hcng-hiv-tb-preventive-therapy-vs\"> </a><ul><li>Include these codes as defined in <a href=\"CodeSystem-ng-hiv-care-art-codes-cs.html\"><code>https://fhir-ig.digitalhealth.gov.ng/CodeSystem/ng-hiv-care-art-codes-cs</code></a><span title=\"Version is not explicitly stated, which means it is fixed to the version provided in this specification\"> version ?0.0.0</span><table class=\"none\"><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><b>Code</b></td><td><b>Display</b></td><td><b>Definition</b></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-ng-hiv-care-art-codes-cs.html#ng-hiv-care-art-codes-cs-tpt-1\">tpt-1</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">Isoniazid (6H)</td><td>Source form code 1: Isoniazid for six months.</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-ng-hiv-care-art-codes-cs.html#ng-hiv-care-art-codes-cs-tpt-2\">tpt-2</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">Isoniazid and Rifapentine (3HP)</td><td>Source form code 2.</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-ng-hiv-care-art-codes-cs.html#ng-hiv-care-art-codes-cs-tpt-3\">tpt-3</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">Isoniazid and Rifampicin (3HR)</td><td>Source form code 3.</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-ng-hiv-care-art-codes-cs.html#ng-hiv-care-art-codes-cs-tpt-4\">tpt-4</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">CTX/INH/B6 FDC (QTIP)</td><td>Source form code 4: Cotrimoxazole/Isoniazid/Pyridoxine fixed-dose combination.</td></tr></table></li></ul></div>"
